launch=bread('Sharing kit')+intro('DISTRIBUTION, BUILT IN','Give people something useful to share.','Lead with the free checklist. Send anglers to the destination that matches their trip. Track the source—not just the clicks.')+'''<section class="section" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap launch-grid"><div class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">01 / YOUR TRACKABLE LINK</span><h3 class="spaced">Build a campaign link.</h3><form data-form="campaign"><div class="form-field"><label for="campaign-domain">Published site origin</label><input id="campaign-domain" name="domain" type="url" placeholder="https://your-domain.example" required></div><div class="form-field"><label for="campaign-destination">Destination</label><select id="campaign-destination" name="destination">'''+''.join(f'<option value="{d["id"]}">{d["name"]}</option>' for d in DATA['destinations'])+'''</select></div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-field"><label for="campaign-source">Source</label><input id="campaign-source" name="source" value="guide-partner" required maxlength="80"></div><div class="form-field"><label for="campaign-medium">Medium</label><select id="campaign-medium" name="medium"><option>partner</option><option>organic-social</option><option>email</option><option>paid-social</option><option>video</option></select></div></div><div class="form-field"><label for="campaign-name">Campaign</label><input id="campaign-name" name="campaign" value="free-trip-checklist" required maxlength="80"></div><button class="btn" type="submit">Generate link ↗</button></form><div id="campaign-output" class="code-output" hidden></div><button class="btn outline small" type="button" data-action="copy-campaign" hidden>Copy campaign link</button></div><div class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">02 / OPERATOR INTRODUCTION</span><h3 class="spaced">A useful first message.</h3><p>This is a draft for personal outreach—not an automated sending campaign.</p><pre class="code-output" id="outreach-copy">Hi [Name] — I’m building Fishing Atlas, a free preparation tool for fishing trips. Your clients can mark what they own, see what you provide, and get a checklist for what’s missing. Would you try a preparation link with a few clients? It can sit alongside your existing booking process. Here’s an example: [your campaign link]</pre><button class="btn outline small" data-action="copy-outreach" type="button">Copy outreach draft</button><div class="note spaced">Start with a small set of relevant operators and real feedback. No contacts have been messaged by this app.</div></div><div class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">03 / SHORT-FORM HOOKS</span><h3 class="spaced">Show the problem being solved.</h3><p><b>Hook A:</b> “You booked the fishing trip. Now what do you actually need to bring?”</p><p><b>Hook B:</b> “Before you buy new fishing gear, check what you own—and what your guide already provides.”</p><p><b>Hook C:</b> “One fishing trip. Too many tabs. Here’s a checklist that starts with your destination.”</p><p><b>Demo:</b> choose the trip → mark owned gear → confirm guide equipment → share the remaining list.</p><p><b>Call to action:</b> “Build your free trip checklist.”</p></div><div class="panel"><span class="eyebrow">04 / WHAT TO MEASURE</span><h3 class="spaced">Useful plans before vanity traffic.</h3><p>The code emits page views, plan updates, checklist changes, share actions, shopping clicks, operator clicks and form results. UTM attribution is retained on this browser.</p><p><b>This release:</b> events are available to a connected analytics adapter and recorded locally for debugging. There is no central analytics account connected yet.</p><button class="btn outline small" data-action="export-events" type="button">Export this browser’s events</button><div class="note spaced">Start with operators and personal trip content. Test paid acquisition only after measuring an actual monetized action—not merely checklist clicks.</div></div></div></section>'''
